  "Your hero gains the **^^Sybarite^^** keyword and the following regiment options:\r\nAny **^^Sybarite^^** units": "",
  "**The following universal terrain abilities apply to this terrain feature (Terrain, 1.2):\r\nCover, Impassable**": "**Las siguientes habilidades universales de escenografía se aplican a este elemento de escenografía (Terrain, 1.2):\nCover, Impassable**",
  "Subtract 1 from ward rolls for other friendly units that are visible to this unit and within its combat range.": "",
  "Once Per Battle, Reaction: You declared a **^^Spell^^**, **^^Unbind^^**, or **^^Banish^^** ability for this unit": "",
  "Subtract 1 from casting rolls and chanting rolls for visible enemy units while they are within 12\" of this unit.": "",
  "Set up this unit on the battlefield wholly within 9\" of a battlefield edge and more than 9\" from all enemy units.": "Coloca esta unidad en el campo de batalla totalmente a 9\" o menos de un borde del campo de batalla y a más de 9\" de todas las unidades enemigas.",
  "Set up this unit on the battlefield wholly within 9\" of a battlefield edge and more than 9\" from all enemy units.": "Coloca esta unidad en el campo de batalla totalmente a 9\" o menos de un borde del campo de batalla y a más de 9\" de todas las unidades enemigas.",
  "Subtract 1 from the Damage characteristic of weapons used by enemy units while they are in combat with this unit.": "",
  "If this unit's **Hadzu** is on the battlefield, pick a visible enemy unit within 18\" of this unit to be the target.": "Si el **Hadzu** de esta unidad está en el campo de batalla, elige como objetivo una unidad enemiga visible a 18\" o menos de esta unidad.",
  "Subtract 1 from casting rolls and unbinding rolls for enemy **^^Wizards^^** while they are within 12\" of this unit.": "Resta 1 a las tiradas de lanzamiento y de disipación de los **^^Wizards^^** enemigos mientras estén a 12\" o menos de esta unidad.",
  "This unit can use the 'Power Through' command even if the target has a higher Health characteristic than this unit.": "",
  "Pick a visible friendly **^^Hedonites of Slaanesh Infantry^^** unit wholly within 12\" of this unit to be the target.": "",
  "Once Per Turn (Army), Reaction: Opponent declared a **^^Charge^^** ability for a **^^Hero^^** within 12\" of this unit": "",
  "Pick an enemy unit that had any damage points allocated to it this turn by this unit's shooting attacks to be the target.": "Elige como objetivo una unidad enemiga a la que se le hayan asignado puntos de daño este turno por los ataques de disparo de esta unidad.",
  "**Heal (6)** the target or return a number of slain models to the target with a combined Health characteristic of up to 3.": "",
  "Roll a dice. On a 4+:\r\n• Inflict 1 mortal damage on the target.\r\n• The target is **blissmarked** for the rest of the turn.": "",
  "For the rest of the turn, when determining the target's control score, add the number of damage points it has to the total.": "",
  "While this unit is damaged or has fewer than half its starting models, add 1 to the Rend characteristic of its melee weapons.": "",
  "If this unit has not used a **^^Temptation^^** ability this turn, pick an enemy unit in combat with this unit to be the target.": "",
  "While this unit has 10 or more damage points, the Attacks characteristic of its **Kyazu's Greatblade and Mutants' Claws** is 4.": "",
  "If this unit has not used a **^^Temptation^^** Ability this turn, pick an enemy unit in combat with this unit to the the target.": "",
  "If this unit is a **^^Paragon^^**, pick a visible enemy unit within 12\" of it to be the target, then make a casting roll of 2D6.": "",
  "After that **^^Move^^** ability has been resolved, this unit can move 2D6\" but must end that move in combat with that enemy unit.": "",
  "Until the start of your next turn:\r\n• Halve the target's Move characteristic.\r\n• Halve run rolls and charge rolls for the target.": "",
  "Once Per Turn (Army), Reaction: Opponent declared the 'Eruption of Fury' ability for a unit within 12\" of and visible to this unit": "",
  "Your hero has the **^^Sybarite^^** and **^^Wizard (1)^^** keywords and the following regiment options:\r\nAny **^^Sybarite^^** units": "",
  "Each time a visible enemy unit within 18\" of this unit uses the 'Rally' command, your opponent must make 3 fewer rally rolls of D6.": "",
  "Add 1 to the Attacks characteristic of this unit's **Ravaging Claws** for the rest of the turn if this unit charged in the same turn.": "",
  "Pick up to 3 visible friendly non-**^^Unique Hedonites of Slaanesh War Machines^^** wholly within 12\" of this unit to be the targets.": "",
  "Each time an enemy unit uses a command while it is within 12\" of this unit, give 1 **indulgence point** to this unit, to a maximum of 6.": "",
  "Roll a dice. On a 3+, for the rest of the turn, while this unit has not used a **^^Fight^^** ability, the target has **^^Strike-last^^**.": "",
  "If this unit charged this turn, subtract 3 from the control scores of enemy **^^Infantry^^** units while they are in combat with this unit.": "",
  "Pick each visible enemy unit within 6'' of this unit that did not use a **^^Charge^^** or **^^Fight^^** ability this turn to be the target.": "",
  "Add 1 to the Attacks characteristic of the targets' melee weapons for the rest of the turn. This ability also affects **Companion** weapons.": "",
  "For the rest of the turn, subtract 1 from hit rolls for attacks that target this unit and subtract 1 from hit rolls for this unit's attacks.": "",
  "Once Per Phase (Army), Reaction: Opponent declared a **^^Move^^** ability for a unit within 18\" of and visible to this **^^Manifestation^^**": "",
  "Pick an enemy unit with a lower Control characteristic than this unit that charged this turn and is in combat with this unit to be the target.": "",
  "Your hero has the **^^Daemon^^** and **^^Ward (6+)^^** keywords and the following regiment options:\r\nAny **^^Hedonites of Slaanesh Daemon^^** units": "",
  "For the rest of the turn, the target cannot use a **^^Core^^** ability unless your opponent spends 1 command point to use it as if it were a command.": "",
  "Pick a visible **^^Manifestation^^** within 12\" of this unit and that was not summoned this turn to be the target, then make a banishment roll of 2D6.": "",
  "When making run rolls for this unit, add 1 to the number of dice rolled, then remove 1 dice of your choice and use the remaining dice as the run roll.": "",
  "Pick a friendly non-**^^Hero Hedonites of Slaanesh Daemon^^** unit that started the battle with 3 or more models and has been destroyed to be the target.": "",
  "If this unit did not charge this turn and is in combat, it can move D6\". It can pass through the combat ranges of enemy units and can end that move in combat.": "",
  "The target cannot use reactions or be picked to be the target of reactions used by your opponent or by units in your opponent's army for the rest of the turn.": "",
  "For the rest of the turn, this unit's ranged weapons have **Shoot in Combat** and they also have **Crit (Auto-wound)** for attacks that target that enemy unit.": "",
  "If this unit has not used a **^^Temptation^^** ability this turn, pick a visible friendly **^^Sybarite^^** unit wholly within 12\" of this unit to be the target.": "",
  "Set up a replacement unit with half the number of models from the target unit (rounding up) wholly within 12\" of this unit and more than 9\" from all enemy units.": "Coloca una unidad de reemplazo con la mitad de miniaturas de la unidad objetivo (redondeando hacia arriba) totalmente a 12\" o menos de esta unidad y a más de 9\" de todas las unidades enemigas.",
  "Your hero has the **^^Daemon^^**, **^^Ward (^+)^^** and **^^Wizard (1)^^** keywords and the following regiment options:\r\nAny **^^Hedonites of Slaanesh Daemon^^** units.": "",
  "While they are wholly within 12\" of and visible to this unit, melee weapons used by friendly **^^Hedonites of Slaanesh Infantry^^** units have **Anti-charge (+1 Rend)**.": "",
  "If this unit charged this turn and has not used the 'Power Through' command this turn, it can immediately use the 'Normal Move' ability as if it were your movement phase.": "",
  "This unit can move D6\" but must end that move no further from the closest visible enemy unit than it was at the start of the move. If equidistant to 2 units, pick either.": "",
  "Pick up to 1 visible friendly **^^Sybarite^^** unit and up to 1 visible friendly **^^Hedonites of Slaanesh Daemon^^** unit to be the targets, then make a casting roll of 2D6.": "",
  "If this unit charged this turn, it can move D3+3\". It can pass through enemy models and the combat ranges of enemy units but must end that move within 1/2\" of a visible enemy unit.": "",
  "Roll a D3 for each target. You can re-roll the dice if the target is a **^^Wizard^^** or **^^Priest^^**. On a 2+, inflict an amount tof mortal damage on the target equal to the roll.": "",
  "For the rest of the turn, add 1 to the Damage characteristic of this unit's melee weapons for attacks that target an enemy unit that has a higher Control characteristic than this unit.": "",
  "Your hero has the **^^Sybarite^^** and the following regiment options:\r\nAny **^^Hedonites of Slaanesh^^** units\r\nIn addition, replace their melee weapon with a **Weapon of Seduction**.": "",
  "Roll a number of dice equal to the unmodified charge roll for that **^^Charge^^** ability. For each roll that exceeds the target's Save characteristic, the target suffers 1 mortal damage.": "",
  "This unit can use **^^Charge^^** abilities even if it used a **^^Retreat^^** ability in the same turn. In addition, no mortal damage is inflicted on this unit by **^^Retreat^^** abilities.": "Esta unidad puede usar habilidades de **^^Charge^^** aunque haya usado una habilidad de **^^Retreat^^** en el mismo turno. Además, esta unidad no recibe daño mortal por habilidades de **^^Retreat^^**.",
  "Each time an enemy unit within 12\" of this unit uses an ability that results in any slain models being returned to it, after that ability has been resolved, return 1 slain model to this unit.": "",
  "Pick any number of visible enemy units within 12\" of this unit to be the targets, then make a casting roll of 2D6. Subtract 1 from the casting roll for each target you picked after the first.": "",
  "Pick a visible friendly **^^Hedonites of Slaanesh^^** unit wholly within 12\" of this unit to be the target, then make a casting roll of 2D6. Add 1 to the casting roll if this unit is the target.": "",
  "If that enemy unit does not end the move closer to this **^^Manifestation^^** than it was at the start of the move, inflict D6 mortal damage on it after the **^^Move^^** ability has been resolved.": "",
  "For the rest of the phase, when making charge rolls for this unit, add 1 to the number of dice rolled, to a maximum of 3, then remove 1 dice of your choice and use the remaining dice as the charge roll.": "",
  "Roll a D3 for each target. On a 2+, inflict an amount of mortal damage on the target equal to the roll. If any models are slain by this ability, this unit has **^^Ward (5+)^^** for the rest of the turn.": "Tira un D3 por cada objetivo. Con un 2+, inflige al objetivo una cantidad de daño mortal igual al resultado. Si alguna miniatura queda abatida por esta habilidad, esta unidad tiene **^^Ward (5+)^^** durante el resto del turno.",
  "This unit can use **^^Charge^^** and **^^Shoot^^** abilities even if it used a **^^Retreat^^** ability in the same turn. In addition, no mortal damage is inflicted on this unit by **^^Retreat^^** abilities.": "",
  "Pick up to 1 visible friendly non-**^^Hero Sybarite Infantry^^** unit and up to 1 visible friendly non-**^^Hero Hedonites of Slaanesh Daemon Infantry^^** unit to be the targets, then make a casting roll of 2D6.": "",
  "Pick either a visible friendly **^^Hedonites of Slaanesh Infantry^^** unit wholly within 12\" of this unit or a visible enemy unit wholly within 12\" of this unit to be the target. Then, make a casting roll of 2D6.": "",
  "For the rest of the turn, for each unmodified hit roll of 1 for a combat attack made by that enemy unit that targets this unit, inflict 1 mortal damage on the target after the **^^Fight^^** ability has been resolved.": "",
  "Pick a visible enemy unit within 18\" of this unit to be the enemy target. Then, you can pick another visible friendly **^^Hedonites of Slaanesh Daemon^^** unit wholly within 12\" of this unit to be the friendly target.": "",
  "This unit can use **^^Shoot^^** abilities this turn even if it used a **^^Retreat^^** ability in the same turn. In addition, for the rest of the turn, no mortal damage is inflicted on this unit by **^^Retreat^^** abilities.": "",
  "When this unit moves, it can pass through models in enemy **^^Infantry^^** units and can pass through the combat ranges of enemy **^^Infantry^^** units, but it cannot end a move in combat unless specified in the ability used.": "Cuando esta unidad se mueva, puede atravesar miniaturas de unidades enemigas **^^Infantry^^** y puede atravesar los alcances de combate de unidades enemigas **^^Infantry^^**, pero no puede terminar un movimiento en combate a menos que se especifique en la habilidad usada.",
  "Your hero's **Companion** melee weapons have **Anti-X (+1 Rend)**, where **X** is a one of the following keywords: **^^Infantry^^**, **^^Cavalry^^**, **^^Monster^^**, **^^War Machine^^**, **^^Hero^^**, **^^Wizard^^** or **^^Priest^^**.": "",
  "Add 1 to charge rolls for this unit and the targets for the rest of the turn. In addition, for the rest of the turn, when this unit and the targets use the 'Mutilating Blades' ability, add 1 to the amount of mortal damage inflicted (if any).": "",
  "If you picked a **^^Sybarite^^** target, subtract 1 from ward rolls for damage points inflicted by its combat attacks until thte start of your next turn. If you picked a **^^Daemon^^** target, it has Ward (5+) until the start of your next turn.": "",
  "If the target is a friendly unit, add 2\" to its Move characteristic until the start of your next turn.\r\n\r\n\r\nIf the target is an enemy unit, inflict X mortal damage on it, then **Heal (X)** this unit. X is equal to the number of models in this unit.": "",
  "While this unit's **Vashtiss** is on the battlefield, it has **^^Wizard (1)^^**. In addition, each time you make a casting roll for this unit, you can spend any number of **indulgence points** it has. For each point spent, add 1 to the casting roll.": "",
  "If you picked a **^^Sybarite^^** target, subtract 1 from ward rolls for damage points inflicted by its combat attacks until the start of your next turn. If you picked a **^^Daemon^^** target, it has **^^Ward (5+)^^** until the start of your next turn.": "",
  "Roll a dice. On a 4+, for the rest of the turn, while the target is in combat with this unit, when the target uses an **^^Attack^^** ability, models in the target unit that are in combat with this unit must pick this unit to be the target of their attacks.": "",
  "This unit has **^^Ward (5+)^^** while it is in combat. In addition each time you make a successful ward roll for this unit for a damage point inflicted by a combat attack, inflict 1 mortal damage on the attacking unit after the **^^Fight^^** ability has been resolved.": "",
  "If this unit is not in combat, it can immediately move 2D6\". It can pass through the combat ranges of enemy units but it must end that move within 1/2\" of that **^^Hero^^**. If it does so, this unit has charged, and that **^^Hero^^**'s **^^Charge^^** ability has no effect.": "",
  "You can allocate 1 damage point to the target (ward rolls cannot be made for that damage point). Then, roll a dice. On a 3+ until the start of your next turn, the target can use **^^Charge^^** abilities even if they used a **^^Run^^** or **^^Retreat^^** ability in the same turn.": "",
  "Pick a friendly **Daemonettes** unit that has not used a **^^Fight^^** ability this turn and is within this unit's combat range to be the target. The target can be picked to use a **^^Fight^^** ability immediately after the **^^Fight^^** ability used by this unit has been resolved.": "Elige como objetivo una unidad amiga **Daemonettes** que no haya usado una habilidad de **^^Fight^^** este turno y que esté dentro del alcance de combate de esta unidad. El objetivo puede ser elegido para usar una habilidad de **^^Fight^^** inmediatamente después de resolver la habilidad de **^^Fight^^** usada por esta unidad.",
  "**Heal (X)** this unit, where **X** is the number of damage points allocated to this unit. For the rest of the turn, add 1 to hit rolls and wound rolls for this unit's attacks, and add 1 to save rolls for this unit. At the start of the next turn, this unit is automatically destroyed.": "",
  "Roll 2D6. If this unit charged this turn, add 2 to the roll. If the roll exceeds the target's Health characteristic, 1 model in the target is automatically slain. If the target is a **^^Manifestation^^** and the roll exceeds its banishment value, it is banished and removed from play.": "",
  "If any enemy models were slain by this unit's combat attacks this turn, **Heal (D3)** this unit, and add 1 to the Attacks characteristic of this unit's **Impaling Talons** for the rest of the battle. This unit can be affected by this ability multiple times and the effects are cumulative.": "",
  "This unit can move up to 3\" immediately after that command has been resolved, unless that command is a reaction, in which case this unit can move after the ability that it was reacting to has been resolved. That move can pass through the combat ranges of enemy units, and can end in combat.": "",
  "Roll a dice. If the roll is higher than the target's power level, for the rest of the battle round, while the target is within 18\" of this unit:\r\n• Subtract 1 from the casting rolls and chanting rolls for enemy units while they are within 18\" of this unit.\r\n• Add 1 to this unit's power level.": "",
  "Add the **Steed's Poisoned Tongue** weapon to your hero's warscroll. \r\nIn addition, make the following changes to your hero's warscroll:\r\n• Change the Move characteristic to 14\".\r\n• Change the Health characteristic to 7.\r\n• Replace the **^^Infantry^^** keyword with the **^^Cavalry^^** keyword.": "",
  "If the target is a **^^Paragon^^**, apply the following effect to the target. Otherwise, roll a dice. On a 3+, apply the following effect to the target:\r\n• For the rest of the turn, while the target is wholly within 12\" of this unit, add 1 to the Attacks characteristic of the target's melee weapons.": "",
  "Add the **Exalted Steed's Poisoned Tongue** weapon to your hero's warscroll. \r\nIn addition, make the following changes to your hero's warscroll:\r\n• Change the Move characteristic to 14\".\r\n• Change the Health characteristic to 8.\r\n• Replace the **^^Infantry^^** keyword with the **^^Cavalry^^** keyword.": "",
  "Pick a friendly **^^Paragon^^** that has not used a **^^Fight^^** ability this turn and is within this unit's combat range and visible to this unit to be the target. The target can be picked to use a **^^Fight^^** ability immediately after the **^^Fight^^** ability used by this unit has been resolved.": "",
  "If any damage points were allocated to an enemy **^^Wizard^^** or **^^Priest^^** by this unit's combat attacks this turn and that enemy unit has been destroyed, add 1 to this unit's power level for the rest of the battle. This unit can be affected by this ability multiple times and the effects are cumulative.": "",
  "If the banishment roll equals or exceeds the banishment value on the target's warscroll, it is banished and removed from play.\r\n\r\n\r\nThe next time a visible friendly unit wholly within 12\" of this unit uses a **^^Summon^^** ability, roll an additional D6, to a maximum of 3, when making the casting roll for that ability.": "",
  "You and your opponent must roll off. If you roll higher, pick another unit (friendly or enemy) within the combat range of the enemy unit using the 'Eruption of Fury' ability. That unit is now the target of that 'Eruption of Fury' ability. Your opponent must spend as many **rage dice** as possible as part of that ability, to a maximum of 3.": "",
  "This unit can use **^^Unbind^^** and **^^Banish^^** abilities as if it had **^^Wizard (1)^^**. In addition, each time this unit successfully unbinds a spell, inflict D3 mortal damage on the caster and each time this unit successfully banishes a **^^Manifestation^^**, inflict D3 mortal damage on the unit that summoned that **^^Manifestation^^**.": "",
  "This unit's **Blissbrew Homonculi** are tokens. There is 1 **Blissbrew Homonculus** for every 10 models in this unit.\r\n\r\n\r\nThis unit has **Ward (6+)** while it has any **Blissbrew Homonculi**. If you make an unmodified ward roll of 1 for this unit, remove 1 of this unit's **Blissbrew Hoomonculi** from the battlefield (the damage point is still inflicted).": "",
  "Roll a dice. On a 3+, until the start of your next turn while the target is within x\" of this terrain feature, the target's weapons have the **Companion** weapon ability, where X is determined by the current battle round as follows:\r\n\r\n\r\n**Battle Round 1:** 9\"\r\n**Battle Round 2:** 12\"\r\n**Battle Round 3:** 15\"\r\n**Battle Round 4:** 18\"\r\n**Battle Round 5:** 21\"": "",
  "If any damage points were allocated this turn by this unit's combat attacks to an enemy **^^Wizard^^**, **^^Priest^^**, **^^Unique^^** unit or unit with an artefact of power, and that enemy unit has been destroyed, add 1 to this unit's power level for the rest of the battle. This unit can be affected by this ability multiple times and the effects are cumulative.": "",
  "Until this **^^Manifestation^^** is banished or destroyed, the target is **tongue-tied** while it is within 12\" of this **^^Manifestation^^**. While the target is **tongue-tied**:\r\n\r\n\r\n• It cannot use **^^Run^^** abilities.\r\n• Your opponent must roll a D6 instead of a D3 when determining the amount of mortal damage inflicted on the target when it uses a **^^Retreat^^** ability.": "",
  "Pick a friendly non-**^^Hero Sybarite^^** unit that has not used a **^^Fight^^** ability this turn and is within this unit's combat range to be the target. The target can be picked to use a **^^Fight^^** ability immediately after the **^^Fight^^** ability used by this unit has been resolved. Add 1 to hit rolls for attacks made by this unit and the target for the rest of the turn.": "",
  "When players are alternating picking units to use a **^^Fight^^** ability, when it is your turn to pick a unit, instead of picking 1 unit, you can pick a friendly non-**^^Hero Hedonites of Slaanesh Daemon^^** unit wholly within 18\" of this unit and a friendly non-**^^Hero Sybarite^^** unit wholly within 18\" of this unit. Resolve the second **^^Fight^^** ability immediately after the first.": "",
  "When players are alternating picking units to use a **^^Fight^^** ability, when it is your turn to pick a unit, instead of picking 1 unit, you can pick a friendly non-**^^Hero Hedonites of Slaanesh Daemon^^** unit wholly within 18\" of this unit and a friendly non-**^^Hero Sybarite^^** unit wholly within 18\" of this unit. Resolve the second **^^Fight^^** ability immediately after the first.": "",
  "If this unit charged this turn and the unmodified charge roll was 6+ for the rest of the turn:\r\n\r\n\r\n• This unit has **^^Strike-first^^**.\r\n• The Attacks characteristic of this unit's **Shardslash** is equal to the unmodified charge roll.\r\n• Melee weapons, including **Companion** weapons, used by other friendly **^^Hedonites of Slaanesh^^** units have **Crit (2 Hits) while they are wholly within 12\" of and visible to this unit.": "",
  "Your opponent must decide whether the target will **adulate** or **reject** Sigvald.\r\n\r\n\r\n***Adulate:*** Until the start of your next turn, while the target is in combat with this unit, it tmust pick this unit to be the target of pile-in moves it makes.\r\n\r\n\r\n***Reject:*** Inflict D3+3 mortal damage on the target, then ***Heal (X)*** this unit, where X is the number of damage points inflicted on the target this turn by this ability.": "",
  "This unit can move 3\" immediately after that command has been resolved, unless that command is a reaction, in which case this unit can move after the ability that it was reacting to has been resolved. It can pass through the combat ranges of enemy units and can end that move in combat. If this unit was in combat at the start of the move, it must end that move in combat with the units it was already in combat with at the start of the move.": "",
  "For the rest of the phase, the following effects apply:\r\n\r\n\r\n• This unit's combat attacks that target that enemy unit have **Crit (2 Hits)** and score critical hits on unmodified hit rolls of 5+.\r\n• If the target is destroyed by this unit's combat attacks this phase, add 1 to the Attacks characteristic of melee weapons used by other friendly **^^Hedonites of Slaanesh Daemon^^** units while they are wholly within 12\" of and visible to this unit.": "",
  "Pick 1 of the following musks. Its effects apply for the rest of the turn.\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n***Alluring Musk:***\r\n• This unit's weapons have **Crit (2 Hits)** for attacks that target that enemy unit.\r\n• Add 1 to hit rolls for attacks made by that enemy unit that target this unit.\r\n\r\n\r\n***Psychotropic Musk:***\r\n• Subtract 1 from wound rolls for attacks made by that enemy unit that target this unit.\r\n• Subtract 1 from the Rend characteristic of this units melee weapons.": "",
  "Roll a number of dice equal to the number of models in the enemy target unit. For each 6, inflict 1 mortal damage on the enemy target.\r\n\r\n\r\nThen, you can pick 1 of the following effects:\r\n• **Heal (X)** the friendly target, where X is the number of enemy models slain by this ability this phase.\r\n• Return a number of slain models to the friendly target unit with a total Health characteristic equal to or less than the number of enemy models slain by this ability this phase.": "",
  "If the target is within 6\" of this unit, the target is **gazing into eternity** until the start of your next turn. Otherwise, roll a dice. On a 3+, the target is **gazing into eternity** until the start of your next turn.\r\n\r\n\r\nWhile the target is **gazing into eternity**, it must end all moves no further from this unit than it was at the start of the move and it cannot be removed from the battlefield by an ability that would allow it to be set up again on the battlefield.\r\n\r\n\r\n**Designer's Note:** *This includes pile-in moves.*": "",
  "Pick 1 of the following effects that you did not pick in the previous turn. The effect applies for the rest of the turn:\r\n\r\n\r\n***Sins of Soul:*** While an enemy **^^Wizard^^** or **^^Priest^^** is visible to this unit, add 1 to this unit's power level.\r\n\r\n\r\n***Sins of Flesh:*** This unit's attacks score critical hits on unmodified hit rolls of 5+.\r\n\r\n\r\n***Sins of Mind:*** Each time a visible friendly **^^Hedonites of Slaanesh^^** unit wholly within 12\" of this unit uses the 'Rally' command, you receive 3 additional rally points.": "",
  "Your opponent must decide whether the target will **accept** or **decline** this unit's challenge.\r\n\r\n\r\nIf they **accept**, for the rest of the turn, if this unit is in combat with the target when the target is picked to use a **^^Fight^^** ability, subtract 1 from hit rolls for the target's attacks and all of the target's attacks must target this unit.\r\n\r\n\r\nIf they **decline**, for the rest of the turn:\r\n• The target has **^^Strike-last^^**.\r\n• Add 1 to the Damage characteristic of this unit's melee weapons for attacks that target that enemy unit.": "",
  "Pick 1 of the following effects:\r\n\r\n\r\n***The Dance of Dreaming:*** Pick a visible enemy unit within 6\" of this unit to be the target. For the rest of the turn, if the unmodified hit roll for an attack made by that enemy unit that targets this unit is 1-4, the attack fails and the attack sequence ends.\r\n\r\n\r\n***The Pavane of Slaanesh:*** This unit can move 2D3\". It can move through the combat ranges of enemy units and can end that move in combat.\r\n\r\n\r\n***The Waltz of Lethargy:*** Pick a visible enemy unit within 6\" of this unit to be the target. For the rest of the turn, the target cannot use commands while it is in combat with this unit.": "",
  "Pick 1 of the following delicacies for Glutos to savour. You cannot pick a delicacy that you picked in the previous turn. The effect applies for the rest of the turn.\r\n\r\n\r\n***Hear of a Shadow Daemon:*** While they are wholly within 12\" of this unit, friendly non-**^^Monster Hedonites of Slaanesh^^** units are not visible to enemy units more than 12\" from them.\r\n\r\n\r\n***Blood of an Aelven Princeling:*** Each time a friendly **^^Hedonites of Slaanesh^^** unit wholly within 12\" of this unit uses a **^^Run^^** ability if you  roll a 1-3 when determining the diistance that unit can move, you can use a value of 4 instead.\r\n\r\n\r\n***Crushed Incarnate's Core:*** Add 1 to unbinding rolls and banishment rolls for this unit.\r\n\r\n\r\n***Unspeakable Viscera:*** Inflict D6 mortal damage on each other unit (friendly and enemy) within this unit's combat range.": ""
}
